    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC), launched the  Master of Arts in Digital Journalism Programme  on Thursday, February 15th 2018 at the GSMC campus in Nairobi. The event drew deliberations on East Africa's Changing Media Landscape, focusing on the past, present and future of the media industry in East Africa (EA).",
